WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.626
The single writer is a Go map.

00:00:03.626 --> 00:00:06.905
Two design claims in Google's announcement, read against the code.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.593
The claim, from Google's announcement: Agent Executor's built-in single-writer architecture helps maintain

00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:18.421
consistency and reduces the risk of corruption in that state.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:25.219
The whole single-writer mechanism: one map and a mutex, enforced inside one process.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.452
3 processes the reference manifest deployed against one shared log.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.294
One interruption plus one follow-up message: irreversible actions.

00:00:35.294 --> 00:00:37.633
Taken, 14; asked for, 6.

00:00:37.633 --> 00:00:40.441
The same turn ran three times.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:45.645
Single-writer is enforced inside one process and deployed as three.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.858
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
